        SimpleScheduleAI is an AI-native nurse scheduling service, not a software license. Your nurse manager uploads
        the existing roster via Excel. Our team configures shift rules, FLSA overtime thresholds, and fairness weights.
        You receive three AI-drafted schedule options each cycle to review and approve. When a nurse calls out, the
        system produces a ranked replacement shortlist in seconds, and the manager makes the call.
      </p>
      <p>
        The audit trail logs every AI suggestion and every human decision, which is the documentation <a
          href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-42/chapter-IV/subchapter-G/part-485/subpart-F/section-485.635"
          rel="noopener"
          target="_blank">CMS surveys</a
        > and Texas HHSC hospital licensing checks ask for. The full step-by-step is on <a href="/how-it-works"
          >how it works</a
        >.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Not right for:</strong> Hospitals over 50 beds or those needing deep EHR integration. SimpleScheduleAI is
        purpose-built for the critical access context: 25 or fewer beds, limited IT, Texas compliance, and flat monthly pricing
        so a hospital can verify the overtime and time savings before committing long term.
      </p>

